  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- Introduced LogEngine with asynchronous channel-based batching pipeline.\n\t\t\t- Added multiple sinks: ConsoleLogTarget, FileLogTarget, EmailLogTarget, and ChannelFileLogTarget.\n\t\t\t- Implemented BatchFileLogTarget for high-throughput file I/O with low contention.\n\t\t\t- Added flexible options (FileLogOptions, BatchFileLogOptions, EmailLogOptions) for configuration tuning.\n\t\t\t- Integrated LogFormatter and LogDistributor for extensible message routing.\n\t\t\t- Added NLogix facade for simplified static logging entry points and extensions.\n\t\t\t- Improved async handling, internal exception safety, and batching performance.\n\t\t\t- General cleanup, documentation updates, and unit test enhancements.",
